{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Strategic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101210/extras/bfc6b94b11b1297538ebda00cd8e2186.poster.avif?t=1772744908\" width=930 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101210/extras/bfc6b94b11b1297538ebda00cd8e2186.webm?t=1772744908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101210/extras/bfc6b94b11b1297538ebda00cd8e2186.mp4?t=1772744908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in turn-based, tactical combat against a variety of foes that grow in power as you approach your ultimate goal. Manage your resources, position your units, and unleash powerful abilities at key moments to overcome deadly encounters. Adapt your strategy to the relics and items you discover, and easily respec your party to face any challenge ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Own Legend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101210/extras/318ff98dc53d4038bf9dc1b5164376be.poster.avif?t=1772744908\" width=1006 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101210/extras/318ff98dc53d4038bf9dc1b5164376be.webm?t=1772744908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101210/extras/318ff98dc53d4038bf9dc1b5164376be.mp4?t=1772744908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you face goblins, dragons, or tyrants? Will you journey through an ancient forest or a dark mountain range? Will you attempt to balance your affinity between magic and technology, or choose to help the humble peasants and draw the ire of the nobility? Or will you let fate decide for you? Every choice you make shapes the world, from how it's generated to the abilities the boss will unleash. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit and Build Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a party of up to eight heroes from a roster of 45 unique classes, each with distinct skill trees and talent options. Collect over 100 relics to specialize each unit and build a party capable of conquering your foes. Customize appearances and builds to forge a team that reflects your vision and dominate your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Your Legend Unfold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience over 50 dynamic events across warring factions, each reacting to your past choices and alliances. Shape outcomes from hundreds of branching decisions, earning unique rewards and long term consequences. Every choice forges your path, influences your reputation, and determines how your legend will unfold.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101210?t=1772744908","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101210/3d0b470bd68d5bfb6479f8afd034892315130b66/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772744908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101210/373d98ddcdbb1df093127753c354fc33fd205e4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772744908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101210/373d98ddcdbb1df093127753c354fc33fd205e4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772744908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family 